A padded plus after a quote marker is the quote's text

```
- >  +
# H
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>+</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<section id="H">
  <h1>H</h1>
</section>
```

```
- >  +
> q
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>+</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
```

```
> >  +
  s
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>+
s</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```
